WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.906
Run the project query once so you can see the final
columns The query

00:00:05.932 --> 00:00:11.589
uses several common table expressions The first
stage normalizes

00:00:11.616 --> 00:00:17.498
name email and phone values The second parses
supported dates

00:00:19.231 --> 00:00:25.019
The third ranks duplicates The final SELECT creates
clean output fields

00:00:25.032 --> 00:00:30.056
and a row status We will unpack those stages
separately
